    "de": [
      "Nach zwei Alben mit seiner Band Square One bereitet Matthis ein drittes Werk vor, das eine Hommage an den Musiker Dr. John aus New Orleans ist."
    ],
    "en": [
      "After 2 albums with his band Square One, Matthis prepares a third opus in homage to the musician of New Orleans, Dr John."
    ],
    "it": [
      "Dopo due album con la sua band Square One, Matthis sta preparando un terzo lavoro come tributo al musicista di New Orleans Dr John."
    ],
    "fr": [
